<%- css('css/portal-videosubtitle') %>
<div class="portal-vsub-page" id="top">
  <nav class="portal-breadcrumb" aria-label="현재 위치"><a href="<%- url_for() %>">홈</a><span>›</span><a href="<%- url_for('categories/앱/') %>">앱</a><span>›</span><span>동영상 자막 넣기</span></nav>
  <header class="portal-vsub-hero"><div class="portal-vsub-hero-copy"><span class="portal-section-kicker">ONLINE VIDEO TOOL</span><h1>동영상 자막 넣기</h1><p>영상의 9개 위치에 자막을 배치하고 시간을 지정해 보세요. 작업과 내보내기는 브라우저에서 처리됩니다.</p></div><figure class="portal-vsub-hero-art"><img src="<%- url_for('images/video-subtitle-cover.png') %>" alt="영상의 3×3 위치 그리드와 자막 타임라인을 보여주는 편집 미리보기"></figure></header>
  <div class="portal-vsub-dropzone" id="vsub-dropzone"><input id="vsub-file-input" type="file" accept="video/*" hidden><div><strong id="vsub-upload-title">영상 없이도 자막을 먼저 편집할 수 있습니다</strong><span id="vsub-video-meta">자막을 완성한 뒤 영상 파일을 추가하세요 · MP4 · WebM · MOV</span></div><button type="button" class="portal-vsub-btn is-primary" id="vsub-select-video">동영상 선택</button></div>
  <section class="portal-vsub-workspace" id="vsub-workspace">
    <div class="portal-vsub-main-column">
<section class="portal-vsub-panel portal-vsub-preview-panel"><div class="portal-vsub-panel-head"><div><h2>영상 미리보기</h2><span class="portal-vsub-meta">영상을 추가하면 미리보기와 재생 컨트롤을 사용할 수 있습니다.</span></div><div class="portal-vsub-actions"><button id="vsub-toggle-grid-btn" type="button" class="portal-vsub-btn" disabled>그리드 숨기기</button><button id="vsub-change-video-btn" type="button" class="portal-vsub-btn">영상 변경</button></div></div>
      <div id="vsub-stage" class="portal-vsub-stage is-empty"><div id="vsub-stage-empty" class="portal-vsub-stage-empty"><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span><strong>영상 미리보기</strong><small>영상을 불러오기 전에도 자막 문구와 시간을 편집할 수 있습니다.</small><button type="button" class="portal-vsub-btn is-primary" id="vsub-stage-select-video">영상 불러오기</button></div><div class="portal-vsub-stage-inner"><video id="vsub-video" playsinline preload="metadata" hidden></video><canvas id="vsub-preview-canvas" hidden></canvas><div id="vsub-grid-overlay" class="portal-vsub-grid-overlay" aria-label="자막 위치 선택" hidden></div></div></div>
      <div class="portal-vsub-player"><button id="vsub-back-btn" type="button" aria-label="1초 뒤로" disabled>−1초</button><button id="vsub-play-btn" type="button" disabled>재생</button><button id="vsub-fwd-btn" type="button" aria-label="1초 앞으로" disabled>+1초</button><span id="vsub-time-display">영상 미선택 · 시간 입력 가능</span><button id="vsub-mute-btn" type="button" disabled>음소거</button></div><input id="vsub-seekbar" class="portal-vsub-seekbar" type="range" min="0" max="1000" value="0" aria-label="영상 탐색" disabled>
    </section>
<section class="portal-vsub-panel portal-vsub-timeline-panel"><div class="portal-vsub-timeline-head"><div><h2>자막 타임라인</h2><p class="portal-vsub-panel-hint">막대를 끌어 구간을 옮기고, 양 끝을 끌어 시작·종료 시간을 조정하세요.</p></div><span id="vsub-timeline-range"></span></div><div id="vsub-timeline-track" class="portal-vsub-timeline-track" aria-label="자막 타임라인"></div></section>
<section class="portal-vsub-panel portal-vsub-list-panel"><div class="portal-vsub-panel-head"><div><h2>자막 목록 <span id="vsub-sub-count" class="portal-vsub-count">0</span></h2><p class="portal-vsub-panel-hint">항목을 선택해 문구와 시간을 다시 편집할 수 있습니다.</p></div><button type="button" class="portal-vsub-btn" id="vsub-clear-all-btn">전체 초기화</button></div><ul id="vsub-sub-list" class="portal-vsub-sub-list"><li class="portal-vsub-empty">자막을 추가하면 여기에 표시됩니다.</li></ul></section>
    </div>
<aside class="portal-vsub-panel portal-vsub-editor"><div class="portal-vsub-editor-heading"><div><h2 id="vsub-form-title">새 자막 추가</h2><p class="portal-vsub-panel-hint">문구와 표시 시간을 설정하세요.</p></div></div><label class="portal-vsub-label" for="vsub-text-input">자막 문구</label><textarea id="vsub-text-input" rows="3" placeholder="자막 내용을 입력하세요"></textarea><div class="portal-vsub-time-fields"><div class="portal-vsub-time-row"><label>시작 시간<input id="vsub-start-input" type="text" value="00:00.0"></label><button id="vsub-set-start-btn" type="button" class="portal-vsub-btn">현재 시간</button></div><div class="portal-vsub-time-row"><label>종료 시간<input id="vsub-end-input" type="text" value="00:03.0"></label><button id="vsub-set-end-btn" type="button" class="portal-vsub-btn">현재 시간</button></div></div>
      <div class="portal-vsub-editor-position"><div class="portal-vsub-editor-heading"><div><h3>화면 위치</h3><p class="portal-vsub-panel-hint">미리보기 그리드를 눌러 위치를 고를 수 있습니다.</p></div></div><div id="vsub-mini-grid" class="portal-vsub-mini-grid" aria-label="자막 위치 선택"></div><button id="vsub-apply-all-pos-btn" type="button" class="portal-vsub-btn portal-vsub-wide">현재 위치를 모든 자막에 적용</button></div>
      <div class="portal-vsub-select-row"><label>스타일<select id="vsub-style-preset"><option value="box-translucent">반투명 검정 박스</option><option value="outline-only">외곽선 전용</option><option value="box-solid">불투명 검정 박스</option></select></label><label>글자 크기<select id="vsub-font-size"><option value="sm">작게</option><option value="md" selected>보통</option><option value="lg">크게</option><option value="xl">매우 크게</option></select></label><label>여백<select id="vsub-margin-ratio"><option value="0.02">좁게</option><option value="0.05" selected>보통</option><option value="0.08">넓게</option></select></label></div>
      <div class="portal-vsub-actions portal-vsub-save-actions"><button id="vsub-save-sub-btn" type="button" class="portal-vsub-btn is-primary">자막 추가</button><button id="vsub-cancel-edit-btn" type="button" class="portal-vsub-btn" hidden>수정 취소</button></div>
      <div class="portal-vsub-export-section"><h3>내보내기</h3><button id="vsub-export-btn" type="button" class="portal-vsub-btn is-export" disabled>자막 입힌 동영상 다운로드</button><div id="vsub-export-progress" class="portal-vsub-progress" hidden><span id="vsub-export-bar"></span></div><span id="vsub-export-status" class="portal-vsub-meta" aria-live="polite"></span><button id="vsub-cancel-export-btn" type="button" class="portal-vsub-btn" hidden>내보내기 취소</button><div class="portal-vsub-actions portal-vsub-file-actions"><button id="vsub-export-srt-btn" type="button" class="portal-vsub-btn">SRT 내보내기</button><button id="vsub-import-srt-btn" type="button" class="portal-vsub-btn">SRT 불러오기</button><input id="vsub-srt-input" type="file" accept=".srt,.vtt" hidden></div></div>
    </aside>
  </section><div id="vsub-toast" class="portal-vsub-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
</div>
<script src="<%- url_for('js/video-subtitle/state.js') %>"></script><script src="<%- url_for('js/video-subtitle/exporter.js') %>"></script><script src="<%- url_for('js/video-subtitle/app.js') %>"></script>
